1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his trials, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Wizard King Julius Novachrono had successfully shielded the people of Clover from an assault by Licht, leader of the Eye of the Midnight Sun.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000
But his courageous act came at a heavy cost.

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000
What happened here? Tell me, fangents!

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Salutations, Yami, is it? You may call me Licht.

8
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Yami attempted to launch a counterattack.

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Dark magic. Now dark cloaked.

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Dimension Slash!

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,000
But Licht escaped. And, as for Julius...

12
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,000
I'm leaving the rest to you now.

13
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Yes, sir.

14
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:17,000
This is where we must bid each other farewell.

15
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,000
The Great Rebirth will start with you.

16
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Only now is Licht finally beginning to reveal his true intentions for this world.

17
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Nintendo World.

18
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Oh...

19
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Oh...

20
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Oh...

21
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Oh...

22
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Oh...

23
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:48,920
何年先だって語って 信じたいから今笑って

24
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:54,400
愛も愛も愛 確かな約束が欲しくて

25
00:01:54,400 --> 00:02:00,500
楽しくなりそうな方へ 一緒に走っていこうね

26
