We fear crying in black

30
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:17,160
We keep waiting

31
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,980
Wait till wait

32
00:02:18,980 --> 00:02:21,940
Bye bye

33
00:02:21,940 --> 00:02:23,740
Don't try to walk away

34
00:02:23,740 --> 00:02:27,320
We try again

35
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:30,720
Just wait and wait

36
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:33,720
ière to Eastern place

37
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:34,820
I'm sorry

38
00:02:34,820 --> 00:02:37,740
Let pouco from our Newmanza

39
00:02:37,740 --> 00:02:42,240
果たしたい僕の気持ちが本当のことね

40
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:44,080
Baby, if I lie

41
00:03:07,740 --> 00:03:09,540
Wow, I can't believe it

42
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:13,360
Licked and his sword magic have been chosen by the four-leaf clover grimoire

43
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:15,960
What's so exciting, Mom?

44
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,140
Well, my dear

45
00:03:17,140 --> 00:03:19,880
Only a select few can get a grimoire like that

46
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:21,980
And it comes with an extra helping of good luck

47
00:03:21,980 --> 00:03:23,160
Oh

48
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:28,680
Licked in his four-leaf grimoire

49
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:31,560
Wow, he's so cool

50
00:03:37,740 --> 00:03:38,680
There you are

51
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:43,840
This kid again?

52
00:03:44,380 --> 00:03:46,800
Look, stop coming over here and bugging us every day

53
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,020
It's such a pain

54
00:03:48,020 --> 00:03:49,240
Get lost

55
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:52,380
I'm not here because I wanted to hang out with you

56
00:03:52,380 --> 00:03:53,980
What'd you say, Shorty?

57
00:03:53,980 --> 00:03:56,000
Oh, I don't mind if he stays, Raya

58
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,620
This isn't a bother to me at all

59
00:03:57,620 --> 00:03:59,780
Thank you for stopping by

60
00:03:59,780 --> 00:04:00,900
I'm glad you're here

61
00:04:00,900 --> 00:04:02,520
Whatever

62
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:06,760
What do you think about all this?

63
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:12,320
You know, there's been a lot of talk about humans planning to attack us

64
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:15,420
I'm sure it's a rumor

65
00:04:15,420 --> 00:04:18,500
It's still a possibility though, isn't it?

66
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:19,820
I mean, think

67
00:04:19,820 --> 00:04:22,600
The human race is so wicked and mean-spirited

68
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:24,380
They slaughter animals for the sport of it

69
00:04:24,380 --> 00:04:26,120
Without ever giving it a second thought

70
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:29,360
They don't have much power on their own

71
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:32,240
But a big group can be dangerous when they get carried away

72
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:36,020
Even though we elves help them recover from natural disasters

73
00:04:36,020 --> 00:04:37,020
A long time ago

74
00:04:37,020 --> 00:04:39,760
They're probably afraid

75
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:40,680
What?

76
00:04:41,580 --> 00:04:42,840
Both sides are afraid

77
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:46,280
We have things in common, but we fear what we don't know

78
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:47,940
Regardless of that

79
00:04:47,940 --> 00:04:51,500
This land blesses everyone equally with magical grimoires

80
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:54,300
So, why wouldn't we understand each other?

81
00:04:58,060 --> 00:04:59,100
What's that thing?

82
00:05:00,780 --> 00:05:03,480
A tornado of natural mana running wild

83
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:06,020
It's awfully big, isn't it?

84
00:05:06,300 --> 00:05:08,340
Yeah, but it should die down on its own

85
00:05:08,340 --> 00:05:11,180
Man, talk about a pain

86
00:05:11,180 --> 00:05:13,120
What's that?

87
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:24,020
What's he doing?

88
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:28,160
Looks like there's someone inside the tornado

89
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,080
Yeah, it does

90
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,840
Sword magic

91
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:34,180
Now, origin flash

92
00:05:34,180 --> 00:05:36,700
Light magic

93
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:39,040
Lamp of Avior

94
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:49,060
He's okay

95
00:05:49,060 --> 00:05:52,080
Licht is amazing stopping that big thing

96
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:53,640
But wait

97
00:05:53,640 --> 00:05:57,900
That light mage was using spells that were just as powerful as his are

98
00:05:57,900 --> 00:06:00,040
I wonder who that guy is

99
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:03,280
You're not hurt, are you?

100
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:04,780
No, I'm fine

101
00:06:04,780 --> 00:06:07,040
Thank you for saving me

102
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:11,780
Tatia, don't leave the castle like that

103
00:06:11,780 --> 00:06:13,080
I'm sorry

104
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:15,780
Besides, a wind magic user like you

105
00:06:15,780 --> 00:06:18,300
Isn't supposed to be getting herself caught in a mana tornado

106
00:06:18,300 --> 00:06:19,260
What were you thinking?

107
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:23,040
Thank you for helping my sister

108
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,040
It's no...

109
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:38,560
Hey, look at his grimoire

110
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,620
It's a four-leaf just like yours

111
00:06:40,620 --> 00:06:42,580
But he's human

112
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:54,180
Lick's been spending quite a lot of time with those two lately

113
00:06:54,180 --> 00:06:55,880
You can say that again

114
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:58,960
Seems like he's happy to have some human friends

115
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,880
But hey

116
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,660
They really are good people

117
00:07:02,660 --> 00:07:06,360
Apparently they have the same idea about society that he does

118
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,240
Idea?

119
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:11,660
They all believe that humans and elves can figure out how to live together peacefully

120
00:07:11,660 --> 00:07:13,020
Ah, is that so

121
00:07:13,020 --> 00:07:16,160
It's odd to see an elf making friends with humans

122
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,840
But if he's doing it

123
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:20,220
Then I guess it must not be such a bad thing

124
00:07:20,220 --> 00:07:22,340
Besides

125
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:26,360
That light mage was good enough to be chosen by the four-leaf clover grimoire too

126
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:28,080
So they're not that different

127
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:38,040
Let's foster understanding

128
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:41,680
Your elvish mana really is a remarkable thing

129
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:45,480
If we combine that with our own magic item technology

130
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:48,580
This land will be safer and more prosperous

131
00:07:48,580 --> 00:07:51,980
Let's all work together, hand in hand

132
00:07:51,980 --> 00:08:04,880
Is it true? You're with child?

133
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:08,680
With you for parents, it'll be a lovely baby

134
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:10,180
Hey, congrats, Tetya

135
00:08:10,180 --> 00:08:11,700
And you too, I guess

136
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:14,700
Well, thank you for including me, Raya

137
00:08:14,700 --> 00:08:18,260
What are you pouting about, Tiny?

138
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,020
It's nothing

139
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:21,600
You're still little

140
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,120
You'll understand one day

141
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,400
Would you shut up?

142
00:08:24,740 --> 00:08:27,240
Stop talking down to me like I'm some stupid baby

143
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:29,700
Excuse me then, big man

144
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:31,740
Oh, hey, there you are

145
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:37,660
Hello, Raya

146
00:08:37,660 --> 00:08:40,740
Let me guess, waking up is a pain too now?

147
00:08:40,860 --> 00:08:41,840
You're the worst

148
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,580
Aw, get off my case

149
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:45,140
Oh, and Potri

150
00:08:45,140 --> 00:08:48,680
I can see you're still clinging on to Licht like nobody's business

151
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:52,200
He's gonna belong to a human after tomorrow's big ceremony

152
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:54,340
So you better start letting go of him

153
00:08:54,340 --> 00:08:55,920
Leave me alone, Raya

154
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:58,240
That's my choice to make, not yours

155
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:59,760
Hey, watch your tone

156
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:00,760
It's alright

157
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:03,920
Even after we get married, Licht will still belong to everybody

158
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:07,200
Man, you human princesses are so generous

159
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:10,220
I'd be careful of what I promise if I were you, though, Tetya

160
00:09:10,220 --> 00:09:14,000
Before long, there won't be any room in his busy schedule to spend time with you

161
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:16,920
You don't have to be so blunt about things

162
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:18,720
Potri knows what to expect

163
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:22,800
So what's it like, knowing that you'll be a father in a few months' time?

164
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:26,000
I can sense that the mana has blessed our lives as well

165
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:30,980
When our child arrives, we know that your kind will welcome it, and we're very grateful

166
00:09:30,980 --> 00:09:35,280
This little one here is the key to our future

167
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:38,120
The bridge to unite elves in humankind

168
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:57,980
Good luck! We wish you the best!

169
00:09:58,820 --> 00:09:59,620
Congratulations!

170
00:10:00,900 --> 00:10:02,800
Thank you all very much

171
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:08,820
Take care of her

172
00:10:08,820 --> 00:10:10,040
Okay, Licht?

173
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:11,120
Yes

174
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:13,680
I swear I'll keep her safe no matter what

175
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:17,760
My friends, thank you for joining us

176
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:23,260
Come to think of it, aren't you receiving your grimoire tomorrow?

177
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:25,020
Wow, you remembered?

178
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:27,620
Well, how could I forget something so important?

179
00:10:27,620 --> 00:10:33,000
I look forward to seeing what kind of grimoire chooses you as its owner

180
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,160
Me too!

181
00:10:34,580 --> 00:10:35,380
How sweet!

182
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:36,920
I want to be a bride

183
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:40,260
I'm sure you'll meet your soulmate one day too, Fauna

184
00:10:40,260 --> 00:10:42,220
Yeah, and hopefully soon

185
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:44,520
May the rest of your days be happy ones

186
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:45,360
Thank you

187
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:48,540
And you better tell me if this guy's unfaithful

188
00:10:48,540 --> 00:10:50,360
I'll smack him around for you

189
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:52,960
Raya, don't say that

190
00:10:52,960 --> 00:10:54,820
Ah, it's all in fun

191
00:10:54,820 --> 00:10:57,120
He looks like he's really happy

192
00:10:57,120 --> 00:11:01,580
But to tell the truth, he kind of always looked happy

193
00:11:01,580 --> 00:11:04,300
I hate to admit it

194
00:11:04,300 --> 00:11:08,820
But it seems like the ones who have made him even happier are her and that other human

195
00:11:08,820 --> 00:11:10,340
Let's foster understanding

196
00:11:10,340 --> 00:11:13,380
I wonder

197
00:11:13,380 --> 00:11:17,260
Can we really come to understand each other like he said we could?

198
00:11:18,260 --> 00:11:19,580
Licht believes it's possible

199
00:11:19,580 --> 00:11:21,300
Maybe they're right

200
00:11:21,300 --> 00:11:23,260
Elves and human beings

201
00:11:23,260 --> 00:11:24,960
Living side by side

202
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:30,220
What's going on?

203
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:33,120
It's the humans, they're attacking us!

204
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:37,080
Everyone, this way!

205
00:11:37,220 --> 00:11:37,880
Let's hurry!

206
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:40,500
My spells won't work

207
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:42,880
Our magic

208
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:44,340
It's been sealed away

209
00:11:44,340 --> 00:11:46,940
Get down!

210
00:11:46,940 --> 00:11:56,420
You have to get away from here

211
00:11:56,420 --> 00:12:00,900
Hateful humans

212
00:12:00,900 --> 00:12:05,700
This is life magic

213
00:12:05,700 --> 00:12:07,200
Does that mean?

214
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:11,740
No, this is a mistake

215
00:12:11,740 --> 00:12:13,840
It's not true

216
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:17,500
I won't accept it

217
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:21,920
Please, stay with me

218
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:23,380
Open your eyes

219
00:12:23,380 --> 00:12:28,440
What's happening?

220
00:12:29,140 --> 00:12:30,220
It's been a dream

221
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:31,360
You can't die

222
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:31,680
You've been a dream

223
00:12:31,680 --> 00:12:33,760
No, I refuse to believe it

224
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:34,740
It's not real

225
00:12:34,740 --> 00:12:35,620
It's not real

226
00:12:35,620 --> 00:12:37,000
None of this is real

227
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,740
No, no, no

228
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:41,980
No way, no way, no way, no way, no way

229
00:12:41,980 --> 00:12:43,320
People won't accept it

230
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:45,480
I will never

231
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:51,980
Forgive

232
00:12:51,980 --> 00:12:53,780
You are

233
00:12:53,780 --> 00:12:53,820
You are

234
00:12:53,820 --> 00:13:07,780
You are

235
00:13:07,780 --> 00:13:09,780
You are

236
00:13:09,780 --> 00:13:11,780
You are

237
00:13:11,780 --> 00:13:22,100
Is that you, Ligt?

238
00:13:22,100 --> 00:13:27,940
Answer me

239
00:13:27,940 --> 00:13:37,360
Ligt

240
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:48,940
What is this place?

241
00:13:49,620 --> 00:13:50,760
What happened to me?

242
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:52,920
I thought

243
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:54,460
I was dead

244
00:13:54,460 --> 00:13:57,240
These hands

245
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:58,740
They're not mine

246
00:13:58,740 --> 00:14:04,000
I look like

247
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:04,800
Ligt

248
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:06,940
What is this?

249
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:09,000
Have I become him somehow?

250
00:14:09,820 --> 00:14:10,660
Did my spirit

251
00:14:10,660 --> 00:14:12,960
Implant itself in his body?

252
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:15,560
That's not it

253
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:18,120
Judging by how this mana feels

254
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,900
The body I'm in is human

255
00:14:19,900 --> 00:14:22,600
A human that looks like Ligt

256
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:24,420
I see

257
00:14:24,420 --> 00:14:26,580
So I really did die

258
00:14:26,580 --> 00:14:30,140
Whatever Ligt unleashed when our magic was sealed away

259
00:14:30,140 --> 00:14:32,600
It must have been some kind of forbidden spell

260
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:33,140
It must have been some kind of forbidden spell

261
00:14:33,140 --> 00:14:35,800
And something extremely powerful too

262
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:38,240
Like reincarnation magic

263
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:42,660
This light

264
00:14:42,660 --> 00:14:49,700
I can sense them

265
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:51,320
Every single one

266
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:55,680
I can feel Raya's soul and the souls of all the other elves in this village

267
00:14:55,680 --> 00:15:00,040
Ligt must have done this in the final few seconds of his life

268
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:03,720
And all for the sake of our people

269
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:10,520
But so far

270
00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:13,700
It seems like I'm the only one who's been completely revived

271
00:15:13,700 --> 00:15:16,000
Oh yeah

272
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,200
His grimoire

273
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:20,660
It chose to bond with Ligt

274
00:15:20,660 --> 00:15:23,260
The soul that truly belongs inside this body

275
00:15:23,260 --> 00:15:25,180
So I won't be able to use it

276
00:15:25,180 --> 00:15:29,520
I'm not sure whether or not this was meant to happen to me

277
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:32,200
But I am the only one who came back to life

278
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,380
